    longDescription: 'CSP Tool provides both a Content Security Policy generator and evaluator — build a new CSP by toggling source directives with explanations, or paste an existing policy to get a security audit with specific vulnerability warnings. Security engineers use it to implement CSP headers that block XSS attacks without breaking third-party scripts, developers use it to understand why the browser is blocking a legitimate resource, and DevOps teams use it to document and review CSP changes before deployment.',
